Jet Atlas

Jet Atlas is an independent educational website about military aircraft. Browse aircraft by manufacturer and explore their history, roles, key facts, photographs, and interactive 3D models.

Features

Manufacturer pages for Lockheed Martin, Sukhoi, Dassault Aviation, and Northrop Grumman

Individual aircraft profiles with historical information and selected specifications

Interactive 3D model viewers on supported aircraft pages

Responsive layout for desktop and mobile screens

Built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript; no build step or backend required

Aircraft

Lockheed Martin: F-35 Lightning II and F-22 Raptor

Sukhoi: Su-57

Dassault Aviation: Rafale

Northrop Grumman: YF-23 Black Widow II and B-2 Spirit

The YF-23 profile covers the Northrop and McDonnell Douglas prototype team.

Run Locally

Download or clone the repository.

Open the project folder in Visual Studio Code.

Open index.html with the Live Server extension.

An internet connection is needed to load the embedded Sketchfab 3D models.